<title>UK: EBRD sets NZ$100 million April 1998 bond.</title>
<headline>EBRD sets NZ$100 million April 1998 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Morgan Stanley International and Tokyo Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN BANK FOR RECONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.35	MATURITY    21.APR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    21.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
